cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Vendor Status Dashboard"
abstract: >-
  A Cloudflare Worker that monitors the live operational status of a
  configurable SaaS vendor set by polling each vendor's own public status
  endpoint, normalizing results through a runtime-agnostic engine that fails
  closed (an unverifiable status is unknown, never operational), and serving
  a single-pane dashboard from a D1-backed snapshot.
type: software
authors:
